F326   20 F2                  BRA   st   
F328                             ; ---- the tail ---------------------------------------------------------------
F328                             ; "/" is the last handler, so what follows its first byte may lie past the
F328                             ; second range: the divide itself and the routines after it.
F328                             ; "/" ( a b -- q r ): the remainder is on top. Truncates toward zero; r takes
F328                             ; a's sign. Divide |a| by |b|, then q gets the sign of a XOR b and r the sign
F328                             ; of a. Dividing by zero is not checked: it returns two cells of no meaning.
F328   A6 42        H_DIV:    LDA   2,U   
